cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "OrthoMeasure Pro"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based tool for measuring hip parameters on pelvic X-rays:
  acetabular index (AI), Reimers migration percentage (MP), neck-shaft
  angle (NSA), center-edge angle (CE), Sharp angle and relative acetabular
  depth. All processing runs locally in the browser. Developed with AI
  assistance from Google Gemini 3 Pro.
authors:
  - family-names: Gu
    given-names: Zhenkun
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-10
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/timkk-beep/orthomeasure-pro"
url: "https://timkk-beep.github.io/orthomeasure-pro/"
keywords:
  - hip
  - radiography
  - migration percentage
  - acetabular index
  - center-edge angle
  - neck-shaft angle
  - medical imaging
